{"seq":1,"slug":"subqueries","title":"子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/subqueries","wordCount":856,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"子查询\">子查询</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>子查询（Subquery）是嵌套在另一条 SQL 语句内部的查询，可以出现在 SELECT、FROM、WHERE、HAVING 等子句中。子查询是 SQL 表达能力的重要扩展——许多复杂的数据查询需求只有通过子查询才能简洁地表达。根据返回结果的形态和与外部查询的关系，子查询分为多种类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[子查询分类] --&gt; B[按返回结果]&#10;    A --&gt; C[按关联性]&#10;    A --&gt; D[按位置]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[标量子查询 - 返回单值]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[行子查询 - 返回单行]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[表子查询 - 返回多行多列]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[非关联子查询 - 独立执行]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[关联子查询 - 引用外部列]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[WHERE 子查询]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[FROM 子查询 - 派生表]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[SELECT 子查询 - 标量]\">graph TD\n    A[子查询分类] --&gt; B[按返回结果]\n    A --&gt; C[按关联性]\n    A --&gt; D[按位置]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[标量子查询 - 返回单值]\n    B --&gt; B2[行子查询 - 返回单行]\n    B --&gt; B3[表子查询 - 返回多行多列]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[非关联子查询 - 独立执行]\n    C --&gt; C2[关联子查询 - 引用外部列]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[WHERE 子查询]\n    D --&gt; D2[FROM 子查询 - 派生表]\n    D --&gt; D3[SELECT 子查询 - 标量]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子查询类型</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n<th>常用运算符</th>\n<th>执行方式</th>\n<th>性能特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标量子查询</td>\n<td>单个值</td>\n<td>=, &gt;, &lt;</td>\n<td>可能缓存结果</td>\n<td>通常高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行子查询</td>\n<td>单行多列</td>\n<td>= (ROW), IN</td>\n<td>一次执行</td>\n<td>高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表子查询</td>\n<td>多行多列</td>\n<td>IN, EXISTS, ANY, ALL</td>\n<td>视关联性而定</td>\n<td>需关注执行计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联子查询</td>\n<td>依赖外部行</td>\n<td>EXISTS, 标量</td>\n<td>每行执行一次（逻辑上）</td>\n<td>优化器可能转换为 JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"where-子查询\">WHERE 子查询</h2><p>WHERE 子句中的子查询是最常见的用法，通过 IN、EXISTS、比较运算符等与外部查询配合过滤行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const whereSubqueries = `&#10;-- IN 子查询：查找有订单的用户&#10;SELECT user_id, username&#10;FROM users&#10;WHERE user_id IN (&#10;    SELECT DISTINCT user_id FROM orders WHERE amount &gt; 1000&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- EXISTS 子查询：语义相同但通常更高效&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username&#10;FROM users u&#10;WHERE EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM orders o &#10;    WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id AND o.amount &gt; 1000&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 比较运算符 + 标量子查询&#10;SELECT product_id, product_name, price&#10;FROM products&#10;WHERE price &gt; (SELECT AVG(price) FROM products);&#10;&#10;-- ALL / ANY 运算符&#10;SELECT product_name, price&#10;FROM products&#10;WHERE price &gt;= ALL (&#10;    SELECT price FROM products WHERE category_id = 5&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- NOT EXISTS：反半连接&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username&#10;FROM users u&#10;WHERE NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> whereSubqueries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- IN 子查询：查找有订单的用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE user_id IN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT DISTINCT user_id FROM orders WHERE amount > 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- EXISTS 子查询：语义相同但通常更高效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT 1 FROM orders o </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id AND o.amount > 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 比较运算符 + 标量子查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_id, product_name, price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE price > (SELECT AVG(price) FROM products);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ALL / ANY 运算符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_name, price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE price >= ALL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT price FROM products WHERE category_id = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- NOT EXISTS：反半连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE NOT EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>IN 与 EXISTS 的选择是经典的 SQL 优化话题。现代优化器通常能自动在两者之间转换，但在某些情况下手动选择仍有意义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>子查询结果集小</td>\n<td>IN</td>\n<td>子查询执行一次，结果集用于哈希查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部查询结果集小</td>\n<td>EXISTS</td>\n<td>外部每行执行一次子查询，短路求值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子查询可能返回 NULL</td>\n<td>EXISTS</td>\n<td>IN 遇到 NULL 有三值逻辑问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要反半连接</td>\n<td>NOT EXISTS</td>\n<td>NOT IN 遇到 NULL 会返回空集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"from-子查询-派生表\">FROM 子查询（派生表）</h2><p>FROM 子句中的子查询称为派生表（Derived Table），它将子查询的结果作为一个临时表使用。派生表必须有别名。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const derivedTables = `&#10;-- 派生表：先聚合再连接&#10;SELECT &#10;    u.username,&#10;    o.order_count,&#10;    o.total_amount&#10;FROM users u&#10;INNER JOIN (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;        SUM(amount) AS total_amount&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;) o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;WHERE o.total_amount &gt; 10000;&#10;&#10;-- 嵌套聚合：求每个类别中超过平均价的商品&#10;SELECT p.product_name, p.price, ca.avg_price&#10;FROM products p&#10;INNER JOIN (&#10;    SELECT category_id, AVG(price) AS avg_price&#10;    FROM products&#10;    GROUP BY category_id&#10;) ca ON p.category_id = ca.category_id&#10;WHERE p.price &gt; ca.avg_price;&#10;&#10;-- 行号生成（在不支持窗口函数的场景中）&#10;SELECT *&#10;FROM (&#10;    SELECT *, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY created_at DESC) AS rn&#10;    FROM events&#10;) ranked&#10;WHERE rn BETWEEN 11 AND 20;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> derivedTables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 派生表：先聚合再连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    o.order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    o.total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(*) AS order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SUM(amount) AS total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) o ON u.user_id = o.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.total_amount > 10000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 嵌套聚合：求每个类别中超过平均价的商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT p.product_name, p.price, ca.avg_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT category_id, AVG(price) AS avg_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) ca ON p.category_id = ca.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE p.price > ca.avg_price;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 行号生成（在不支持窗口函数的场景中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT *, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY created_at DESC) AS rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE rn BETWEEN 11 AND 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关联子查询\">关联子查询</h2><p>关联子查询（Correlated Subquery）引用了外部查询的列，逻辑上对外部查询的每一行都执行一次。虽然看起来效率低，但优化器通常能将其转换为等价的 JOIN 操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const correlatedSubqueries = `&#10;-- 每个类别中价格最高的商品&#10;SELECT p.product_name, p.price, p.category_id&#10;FROM products p&#10;WHERE p.price = (&#10;    SELECT MAX(p2.price) &#10;    FROM products p2 &#10;    WHERE p2.category_id = p.category_id&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- SELECT 中的标量关联子查询&#10;SELECT &#10;    u.username,&#10;    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id) AS order_count,&#10;    (SELECT MAX(amount) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id) AS max_order&#10;FROM users u;&#10;&#10;-- LATERAL 替代关联子查询（PostgreSQL，性能更好）&#10;SELECT u.username, stats.order_count, stats.max_order&#10;FROM users u&#10;CROSS JOIN LATERAL (&#10;    SELECT COUNT(*) AS order_count, MAX(amount) AS max_order&#10;    FROM orders o&#10;    WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;) stats;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> correlatedSubqueries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 每个类别中价格最高的商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT p.product_name, p.price, p.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE p.price = (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT MAX(p2.price) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM products p2 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE p2.category_id = p.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- SELECT 中的标量关联子查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u.username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id) AS order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (SELECT MAX(amount) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id) AS max_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- LATERAL 替代关联子查询（PostgreSQL，性能更好）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.username, stats.order_count, stats.max_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CROSS JOIN LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT COUNT(*) AS order_count, MAX(amount) AS max_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) stats;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关联子查询在 SELECT 列表中作为标量使用时，如果外部查询返回大量行，性能可能成为瓶颈。此时应改写为 LEFT JOIN + 聚合或使用 LATERAL。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子查询优化策略\">子查询优化策略</h2><p>子查询的性能问题通常不在于子查询本身，而在于优化器能否有效地将其转换为更高效的执行计划。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const optimizationPatterns = `&#10;-- 反模式：SELECT 中的多个关联子查询&#10;-- 差：对每个用户执行 3 次子查询&#10;SELECT u.username,&#10;    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id),&#10;    (SELECT SUM(amount) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id),&#10;    (SELECT MAX(created_at) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id)&#10;FROM users u;&#10;&#10;-- 优化：改写为 LEFT JOIN + 单次聚合&#10;SELECT u.username, &#10;    COALESCE(o.cnt, 0) AS order_count,&#10;    COALESCE(o.total, 0) AS total_amount,&#10;    o.latest&#10;FROM users u&#10;LEFT JOIN (&#10;    SELECT user_id, &#10;        COUNT(*) AS cnt, &#10;        SUM(amount) AS total, &#10;        MAX(created_at) AS latest&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;) o ON u.user_id = o.user_id;&#10;&#10;-- 反模式：WHERE IN (大量值的子查询)&#10;-- 当子查询返回上万行时，IN 列表过大&#10;-- 优化：改写为 EXISTS 或 JOIN&#10;SELECT p.* FROM products p&#10;WHERE EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM active_categories ac &#10;    WHERE ac.category_id = p.category_id&#10;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> optimizationPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式：SELECT 中的多个关联子查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差：对每个用户执行 3 次子查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (SELECT SUM(amount) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (SELECT MAX(created_at) FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 优化：改写为 LEFT JOIN + 单次聚合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.username, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COALESCE(o.cnt, 0) AS order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COALESCE(o.total, 0) AS total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    o.latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(*) AS cnt, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SUM(amount) AS total, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MAX(created_at) AS latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) o ON u.user_id = o.user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式：WHERE IN (大量值的子查询)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 当子查询返回上万行时，IN 列表过大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 优化：改写为 EXISTS 或 JOIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT p.* FROM products p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT 1 FROM active_categories ac </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE ac.category_id = p.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>优化方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SELECT 中多个关联子查询</td>\n<td>N+1 查询问题</td>\n<td>LEFT JOIN + 聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE IN (大子查询)</td>\n<td>内存/传输开销</td>\n<td>EXISTS 或 JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套多层子查询</td>\n<td>可读性差、难优化</td>\n<td>CTE 或分步查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不必要的子查询</td>\n<td>增加优化器负担</td>\n<td>直接 JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>子查询按返回结果分为标量、行、表三种类型，按关联性分为非关联和关联子查询</li>\n<li>WHERE 中 EXISTS 通常优于 IN，尤其在涉及 NULL 值和需要反半连接（NOT EXISTS）时</li>\n<li>派生表（FROM 子查询）将子查询结果作为临时表使用，适合先聚合再连接的场景</li>\n<li>关联子查询逻辑上每行执行一次，优化器通常能转换为 JOIN，但 SELECT 列表中的多个关联子查询应手动优化</li>\n<li>子查询优化的核心思路：减少执行次数（关联→非关联）、减少数据传输（IN→EXISTS）、提升可读性（嵌套→CTE）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子查询","id":"子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WHERE 子查询","id":"where-子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"FROM 子查询（派生表）","id":"from-子查询-派生表"},{"level":2,"text":"关联子查询","id":"关联子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"子查询优化策略","id":"子查询优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"连接查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/joins"},"next":{"title":"窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/window-functions"}}